# CR-167: local design references (mockup screenshots, exports) kept beside the
# repo while working on a screen. Not repository content — the approved mockups
# live in the Design artifacts `docs/design.md` points to, and these files are
# large binaries that would bloat history.
references/

# CR-212: Next 16 writes these itself on `next dev`
# (node_modules/next/dist/server/lib/generate-agent-files.js) to point coding
# agents at the installed version's own docs. Machine-generated and re-created
# on every dev run, and their content is tied to whichever Next version is
# installed locally — not repository content. This project's own agent
# instructions live in .claude/ and the root CLAUDE.md.
apps/web/AGENTS.md
apps/web/CLAUDE.md
